# BUG (QA M2): a Gondel rider is pushed off by the camera's left edge and
# falls to her death. D-044 assumes |dx| <= 8 keeps a rider carried back
# away from the screen's left edge, but that only holds if she boards at the
# cabin's spawn end; the camera never scrolls back, so boarding at the far
# end after walking a little further breaks it.
# Steps: st_gilgen_gondeln (A -> B -> C, off C onto the ledge/street at
# x 1401, frame 1133), walk on to x 1433 (camera x 1295, a few steps past the
# ledge), walk back onto the ledge 83-85 and hop onto Gondel C waiting at its
# lower end (x 1296, frame 1342), then stand still on its roof. C travels
# up-left to the pylon (x 1184); at frame ~1380 Resi's hitbox reaches the
# camera's left edge (x 1295) and is held there while the cabin moves on
# under her; she drops off its left end at ~1398 and dies in the ravine at
# 1424 - without any input.
# Expected (D-044): the rider stays on the cabin (it carries her to the
# pylon; e.g. the camera scrolls back for a carried rider, or the cabin's
# carry overrides the screen edge), no death.
# Actual: Died at 1424 (DeathCause::Pit), x stuck at 1295 = camera.x.
# Filmstrip: cargo xtask filmstrip bug_m2_gondel_camera_edge_push --every 10
